description:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join one of France’s fastest-growing foodtech scale-ups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re transforming the way people cook and eat. Through our meal-kit boxes, we help thousands of customers cook delicious, balanced meals at home while reducing food waste and simplifying everyday life.&amp;nbsp;Operating in 15+ countries, HelloFresh is one of the world’s leading foodtech companies. The French market, launched in 2020, has experienced hyper growth and became market leader in 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Behind this growth is a simple formula: technology, data, and a team of ambitious people working together to reinvent food at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of data, strategy, and growth, and have a tangible impact on a fast-scaling business, this internship is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Strategy Data Analyst Intern, you will join the Analytics &amp;amp; Performance team and work closely with the Growth Marketing team to help drive HelloFresh’s growth in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a data partner to business stakeholders, turning complex data into actionable insights that influence key strategic decisions, marketing investment decisions, and customer lifecycle optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly impact critical growth levers such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, and website optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines business analysis, experimentation, and data modeling, giving you end-to-end exposure to how data drives decisions in a growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who want to apply rigorous analytics to real business problems and see their insights translated into concrete growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with modern analytics tools including SQL, Tableau, and Google Sheets, as well as internal data pipelines to analyze large-scale datasets and support data-driven decision-making across the Growth team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive business-impacting analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on key growth topics such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, discount optimization, and marketing channel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, marketing efficiency, and customer lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations for business stakeholders&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Growth Marketing managers and team leads to support strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations that influence budget allocation and growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support experimentation and A/B testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and growth experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of new initiatives and help scale successful strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data products and dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that enable the marketing team to make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, reporting pipelines, and analysis frameworks that help teams scale their decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone curious, analytical, and eager to tackle complex business problems using data.&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable navigating large datasets, structuring ambiguous questions, and translating analyses into insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and ability to structure complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets, and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate data into clear and actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gap-year or final-year student from a top engineering or business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in data, consulting, strategy, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve in one of Europe’s fastest-growing scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to real business decisions driven by data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on HelloFresh boxes, Swile meal vouchers, and Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in the heart of Paris (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invitation to Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with your future managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first days will include dedicated onboarding sessions with key managers across teams to help you understand HelloFresh’s organization and business model.&amp;nbsp;You’ll then quickly dive into your projects and start contributing to the team’s impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
